# Crystal Imperium play test: WILD VARIETY (challenge menu > Features; 30% by default).
# Route 29's own wild Pokemon are Pidgey, Sentret, Hoppip, Rattata and Hoothoot. Twelve wild
# battles start from the same spot at different frame offsets. With WILD VARIETY at 30% some of
# them must be other Pokemon (Gen 1-9); with it OFF none may be, and DexNav lists only the
# route's own Pokemon (Hoothoot and Rattata at night; sDexNavUiDataPtr->landSpecies is at +6).
# dexnav_wild_match checks that the Wild Variety Pokemon are the ones DexNav lists.
!new_game()
!give_mon(155, 5)
!warp(0, 11, 0)
!walkto(34, 14, "yx")
savestate route29.ss
!wild_variety_sample("variety_30", 12)
expecttally variety_30 1 12

reset
!new_game(variety="OFF")
!give_mon(155, 5)
!warp(0, 11, 0)
!walkto(34, 14, "yx")
savestate route29_off.ss
!l_menu("DEXNAV")
wait 120
shot dexnav_variety_off.png
expectne16 *{sDexNavUiDataPtr}+8 0 off_lists_own_pokemon
expect16 *{sDexNavUiDataPtr}+10 0 off_lists_no_variety_pokemon
!wild_variety_sample("variety_off", 12, state="route29_off.ss")
expecttally variety_off 0 0
